# Result tables and figures are generated per campaign, by
# `uv run python -m report render <campaign dir>`, from a result store that
# lives outside this repository (`/data/bench/results/<campaign>/`). They are
# ignored by default so that a dev, smoke or pilot campaign cannot drift into
# the manuscript tree unnoticed.
#
# When a campaign is the one the thesis quotes, commit its tables deliberately:
#     git add -f thesis/generated/results-<campaign>-*.tex
#     git add -f thesis/generated/figures/results-<campaign>-*.tex
#
# `deviations.tex` and `methods-provenance.tex` are NOT ignored: they are
# generated from the manifest and the forks, both of which are in this
# repository, so they are reproducible by anyone who clones it.
results-*
figures/
